§§ `Section 7: false earnings claims [pdf page 12; Overview, pdf page 3]`

-- Misleading but not shown false: the body's sentence, not the Overview's (fork F19).
#ASSERT `7: what section 7 says of the claim` (`an earnings claim` FALSE TRUE `both employees and independent contractors`) EQUALS LIST `may investigate a claim`
#ASSERT `7: what section 7 says of the claim` (`an earnings claim` FALSE FALSE `employees`) EQUALS EMPTY
